---
import { SITE_TITLE, AUTHOR_NAME } from '../consts';

const today = new Date();
const year = today.getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-zinc-200/70 dark:border-zinc-800/70">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
		<div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-8 sm:flex-row">
			<!-- 品牌区 -->
			<div class="max-w-xs">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
					<span
						class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 via-violet-500 to-fuchsia-500 text-sm font-bold text-white"
						aria-hidden="true"
					>
						L
					</span>
					<span class="font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">{SITE_TITLE}</span>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-500">
					{AUTHOR_NAME} 的数字自留地。记录技术笔记、项目复盘与生活随想，把踩过的坑写成文字，分享给同样在路上的人。
				</p>
				<div class="mt-4 flex gap-3">
					<a
						href="https://github.com/larson"
						target="_blank"
						class="text-zinc-400 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-zinc-200"
					>
						<span class="sr-only">{AUTHOR_NAME} 的 GitHub</span>
						<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18"
							><path
								fill="currentColor"
								d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.012 8.012 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"
							></path></svg
						>
					</a>
					<a
						href="https://x.com/larson"
						target="_blank"
						class="text-zinc-400 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-zinc-200"
					>
						<span class="sr-only">{AUTHOR_NAME} 的 X（Twitter）</span>
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16"
							><path
								d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"
							></path></svg
						>
					</a>
					<a
						href="mailto:hi@larson.dev"
						class="text-zinc-400 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-zinc-200"
					>
						<span class="sr-only">发邮件给 {AUTHOR_NAME}</span>
						<svg
							xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
							viewBox="0 0 24 24"
							fill="none"
							stroke="currentColor"
							stroke-width="2"
							stroke-linecap="round"
							stroke-linejoin="round"
							width="18"
							height="18"
							aria-hidden="true"
						>
							<rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect>
							<path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path>
						</svg>
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- 导航 -->
			<nav class="flex gap-10 text-sm" aria-label="页脚导航">
				<div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
					<span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-200">站点</span>
					<a href="/" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-brand-400">首页</a>
					<a href="/blog" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-brand-400">博客</a>
					<a href="/archive" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-brand-400">归档</a>
					<a href="/tags" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-brand-400">标签</a>
				</div>
				<div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
					<span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-200">更多</span>
					<a href="/projects" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-brand-400">项目</a>
					<a href="/links" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-brand-400">友链</a>
					<a href="/about" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-brand-400">关于</a>
					<a href="/rss.xml" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-brand-400">RSS 订阅</a>
				</div>
			</nav>
		</div>

		<div
			class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-2 border-t border-zinc-200/70 pt-6 text-xs text-zinc-400 sm:flex-row dark:border-zinc-800/70 dark:text-zinc-500"
		>
			<span>&copy; {year} {AUTHOR_NAME}。保留所有权利。</span>
			<span>
				由 {AUTHOR_NAME} 设计与构建 · 运行于 Cloudflare 边缘网络
			</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
